OL,3,GNEWSABishop suspended following
OL,4,Acomplaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bishop of Salisbury has been
OL,7,Fsuspended following two complaints
OL,8,Fagainst him being brought to the next
OL,9,Fstage of a Church of England process.
OL,11,FThe church says the suspension of The
OL,12,FRt Revd Stephen Lake is a neutral act
OL,13,Fwhile allegations are progressed and he
OL,14,Fis asked to respond to them.
OL,16,FThe complaints were brought following
OL,17,Fallegations of financial misconduct and
OL,18,Fconcerns raised with the National
OL,19,FSafeguarding Team relating to his
OL,20,Fconduct.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
