OL,3,GNEWSABishop suspended following
OL,4,Acomplaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bishop voluntarily stepped down
OL,7,Ffrom duties in the diocese - which
OL,8,Fcovers most of Wiltshire, Dorset and
OL,9,Fthe Channel Islands - in April and The
OL,10,FRt Revd Karen Gorham, Bishop of
OL,11,FSherborne, is acting Bishop of
OL,12,FSalisbury.
